    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Construction\" title=\"Lightsaber Construction\">Lightsaber Construction</a></i> </p><p>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Modification\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber Modification\">Lightsaber Modification</a> is little more than a small storage compartment capable of holding a single object of Fine size. Typically, this compartment in the weapon's hilt is used to store a useful item such as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Comlink\" title=\"Comlink\">Comlink</a>, hand-held <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Personal_Holoprojector\" title=\"Personal Holoprojector\">Holoprojector</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Code_Cylinder\" title=\"Code Cylinder\">Code Cylinder</a>. </p>",
